**VZ region (EW WZ/ZZ specific):**
- 0 b-tagged jets (b-veto)
- mjj < 110 GeV (two closest-in-φ jets = hadronic W/Z)
- MT2(ℓℓ) > 80 GeV
- E_T^miss bins: 100–150, 150–250, 250–350, >350 GeV

